# Beside defect 510 (lane b16-compiler, 2026-10-09): the qualified calls the
# checker answered with the error type and no diagnostic, so `check` passed
# them and the build stopped at exit 2. Each is now told what the same call
# by an unqualified name is told.
use helper

function main()
    print(helper.DOUBLE(4, 5))  #~ wrong_arity
    print(helper.LIMIT(4))  #~ not_callable
    print(helper.DOUBLE("x"))  #~ type_mismatch
